pension
InquiryPayEquity
/
pension
Definition
The employer's contribution to a pension plan.
Type
PensionArrangement
https://ontology.setu.nl/inquiry-pay-equity#PensionArrangement
Usage notes
This pension information refers specifically to the portion of pension funding paid by the employer, not the employee’s own contributions

